  "classification": "INTEROPERABILITY_PROBLEM",
  "classification_note": "OpenUtau 0.1.565 imports MIDI musical timing into a project with resolution 480. PPQ-960 positions that map exactly onto that grid were preserved exactly; tested positions requiring fractional project ticks were not. Fractional project-tick timing was not preserved: some tested values were truncated downward (1447.5 to 1447, 22.5 to 22), while a 7.5-tick duration became 10, suggesting an additional minimum-duration rule that was not isolated here (UNKNOWN; no universal rounding algorithm is claimed). This is a statement about the tested version, not a general claim that PPQs other than 480 lose precision.",
